"char_end": 4803,
"unit_id": "t0031.u01",
"sent_id": "t0031.s01"
},
{
"start": 219.29,
"end": 222.0,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "The frame matters because it tells you what kind of performance you can expect.",
"char_start": 4804,
"char_end": 4883,
"unit_id": "t0031.u01",
"sent_id": "t0031.s02"
},
{
"start": 222.0,
"end": 223.67,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What is the failure mode?",
"char_start": 4901,
"char_end": 4926,
"unit_id": "t0032.u01",
"sent_id": "t0032.s01"
},
{
"start": 223.67,
"end": 228.0,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of transmission mechanics?",
"char_start": 4927,
"char_end": 4992,
"unit_id": "t0032.u01",
"sent_id": "t0032.s02"
},
{
"start": 228.0,
"end": 230.76,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Honestly, the wear on the chain is the best early indicator of when you'll need to replace the cassette.",
"char_start": 5008,
"char_end": 5112,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s01"
},
{
"start": 230.76,
"end": 232.17,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Shimano components.",
"char_start": 5113,
"char_end": 5166,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s02"
},
{
"start": 232.17,
"end": 234.0,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5167,
"char_end": 5236,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s03"
},
{
"start": 234.0,
"end": 240.0,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Where does it stop working?",
